@startuml rust-language-support-state
title Rust Language Support v1 — LspClient Lifecycle

[*] --> Stopped

Stopped --> Starting : LspClient::start()\n(Cargo.toml detected)
Starting --> Stopped : spawn failed\n(rust-analyzer not on PATH)\n=> LspError::ServerNotFound

Starting --> Initializing : process spawned,\ninitialize request sent
Initializing --> Ready : initialize response received\n(queued requests flushed)

Ready --> Ready : DidOpen / DidChange / DidClose\npublishDiagnostics

Ready --> Exited : process exited\n(crash or normal exit)
Initializing --> Exited : process exited\nbefore handshake completed
Exited --> [*] : LspEvent::ServerExited surfaced;\nno auto-restart (v1)

Exited --> Starting : user clicks\n"Restart Rust Analyzer"
Stopped --> [*] : Cargo.toml no longer\npresent (project switched)

@enduml
